  "description": "Add some fiber to your diet and get after it. With the same carbon fiber frame as the 153 CR DL, a super dependable SRAM GX cable operated drivetrain, hammer reliable DT Swiss hubs and proven Fox Performance Elite suspension components, the Process 153 CR is the all-mountain, burly-trail equivalent of a tailored suit matched with running shoes. It’s here to do business, and is ready for anything the world may throw in its path. All the tools you need to go as big as you dream, and just enough extra style to dare you to go bigger. You have achieved peak LFG. So, what are you waiting for? LFG!",
